    "steam_appid": 2815530,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815530/extras/ded20df578a06bf5ad606c7d99a14e46.avif?t=1727804073\" width=640 height=200 /></span><br><br>The Last Drop takes players on a perilous journey as the last surviving water droplet on Earth. Set in a dark, enemy-filled world, you must battle drought and struggle to survive. Equipped with a variety of weapons, your character must fend off relentless waves of enemies. Your mission is to make strategic decisions to survive this intense battle and restore life to the planet.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815530/extras/adbfb2c28418565b407a5c7b57e71aad.poster.avif?t=1727804073\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815530/extras/adbfb2c28418565b407a5c7b57e71aad.webm?t=1727804073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815530/extras/adbfb2c28418565b407a5c7b57e71aad.mp4?t=1727804073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay and Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unique Combat Mechanics:</strong> Wield an array of weapons and abilities such as water bombs, ice lasers, and mud allies to counter the waves of enemies.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Dynamic Wave Systems: </strong>Each wave brings tougher enemies, demanding careful and strategic planning to ensure survival.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Online Leaderboards: </strong>Achieve high scores and climb to the top of the global leaderboard. Compete with players worldwide and showcase your skills.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Map Customization: </strong>While the game features a single map, players can unlock different sections and customize the terrain to suit their strategies.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815530/extras/b1efa7f99692da26f7c7f1563a646721.poster.avif?t=1727804073\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815530/extras/b1efa7f99692da26f7c7f1563a646721.webm?t=1727804073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815530/extras/b1efa7f99692da26f7c7f1563a646721.mp4?t=1727804073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Graphics and Sounds</h2><br>The Last Drop merges retro pixel art with modern visual effects to create a unique aesthetic. The dark atmosphere and immersive music draw players in, offering a fully engaging gaming experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815530/extras/f4655fe01b10906672514365380be453.poster.avif?t=1727804073\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815530/extras/f4655fe01b10906672514365380be453.webm?t=1727804073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815530/extras/f4655fe01b10906672514365380be453.mp4?t=1727804073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Community and Support</h2><br>Join our vibrant player community to share feedback and discuss strategies with other players. Our support team is always ready to assist you with any issues you encounter.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815530/extras/ded20df578a06bf5ad606c7d99a14e46.avif?t=1727804073\" width=640 height=200 /></span><br><br>The Last Drop takes players on a perilous journey as the last surviving water droplet on Earth. Set in a dark, enemy-filled world, you must battle drought and struggle to survive. Equipped with a variety of weapons, your character must fend off relentless waves of enemies. Your mission is to make strategic decisions to survive this intense battle and restore life to the planet.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815530/extras/adbfb2c28418565b407a5c7b57e71aad.poster.avif?t=1727804073\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815530/extras/adbfb2c28418565b407a5c7b57e71aad.webm?t=1727804073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815530/extras/adbfb2c28418565b407a5c7b57e71aad.mp4?t=1727804073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay and Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unique Combat Mechanics:</strong> Wield an array of weapons and abilities such as water bombs, ice lasers, and mud allies to counter the waves of enemies.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Dynamic Wave Systems: </strong>Each wave brings tougher enemies, demanding careful and strategic planning to ensure survival.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Online Leaderboards: </strong>Achieve high scores and climb to the top of the global leaderboard. Compete with players worldwide and showcase your skills.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Map Customization: </strong>While the game features a single map, players can unlock different sections and customize the terrain to suit their strategies.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815530/extras/b1efa7f99692da26f7c7f1563a646721.poster.avif?t=1727804073\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815530/extras/b1efa7f99692da26f7c7f1563a646721.webm?t=1727804073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815530/extras/b1efa7f99692da26f7c7f1563a646721.mp4?t=1727804073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Graphics and Sounds</h2><br>The Last Drop merges retro pixel art with modern visual effects to create a unique aesthetic. The dark atmosphere and immersive music draw players in, offering a fully engaging gaming experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815530/extras/f4655fe01b10906672514365380be453.poster.avif?t=1727804073\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815530/extras/f4655fe01b10906672514365380be453.webm?t=1727804073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815530/extras/f4655fe01b10906672514365380be453.mp4?t=1727804073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Community and Support</h2><br>Join our vibrant player community to share feedback and discuss strategies with other players. Our support team is always ready to assist you with any issues you encounter.",
